  "name": "Champion Passive Features",
  "description": "§e§lChampion Features:§r\n+20% Size\n+20% Melee Damage\n-10% Damage Taken from most sources\n \n- Retains scales, fire immunity, flight and draconic breath powers.\n- Ember Flames are replaced by §d§lDragon's Breath§r and §d§lDragon Charge§r, which deal magic damage and use dragon-breath effects instead of flame/ignition.\n- No movement, Wet, cramped-space, propulsion or dietary penalties.\n- Wet and cramped-space checks do not suppress your movement bonus, melee bonus, or Gusts of Freedom.\n- Player-facing ability cooldowns recover at 2× rate (50% shorter); charge times, resource costs, and internal ability cadence are unchanged."
